WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:02.730
- OK, Gronkowski family.

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:08.039
I have to start off by saying I have never
seen a group of men that look so much alike.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:11.670
You all look exactly alike.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.520
It's like you’re brothers or something.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.170
This is like a big family reunion.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.520
So I'm excited to talk to you guys about
the YouTube channel. Before we get to that,

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:26.900
Rob, obviously the question right now that everybody
is asking is just like, how close is this new Gronk

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.420
to this “vintage” Gronk? What would you say?

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:31.580
- Oh, wow.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:31.920
- Vintage.
- Well—

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:33.700
Wow.

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:34.300
Vintage.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.680
That is crazy.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:40.810
That's, you know, that's a special word. You know, Vintage Gronk.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:43.600
That sounds like I'm coming out of a movie.

00:00:44.339 --> 00:00:50.580
But, you know, I'm just out there working hard,
just getting back to that football terminology,

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.430
getting my football legs back underneath me,

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:54.840
cuz that's such a thing too.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:01:01.950
You gotta, you gotta actually compete versus other
players in order to get the football legs back.

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:06.480
Now, when I was facing my brothers in basketball and Home Run Derby

00:01:06.645 --> 00:01:09.495
and a lot of other events, it got me ready a little bit.

00:01:09.495 --> 00:01:14.975
And then when I stepped on the field, it was a little bit
different, a little bit faster. But I'm just getting back at

00:01:14.975 --> 00:01:18.425
it, feeling good. You know, just trying to get better every day.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:25.950
And, you know, I got a long camp ahead of me, so there's a
lot of football to be played and a lot of room for improvement

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:26.340
for sure.

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:30.290
- Now, you guys, tell me: What can we expect from the YouTube channel?

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:32.180
I'm very excited for this new content.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:37.130
- Well, first off, how I got ready for the
season this year is because I stayed competing.

00:01:37.365 --> 00:01:43.185
It wasn't necessarily football, but I was doing
everything else, from getting checked in a limo bus,

00:01:43.215 --> 00:01:45.615
you know, to get me prepared for hits up the middle

00:01:45.945 --> 00:01:52.415
all the way to shooting basketball,
competing versus each other, getting paint balls shot

00:01:52.415 --> 00:01:54.815
at me from my brother while I was on a Jet Ski.

00:01:55.025 --> 00:01:56.015
So just put it that way.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:56.705
Imagine paint

00:01:56.705 --> 00:02:01.415
balls, you know, the pain of paint balls as you're
flying across on a Jet Ski and getting hit with it.

00:02:01.415 --> 00:02:02.855
Got me ready for training camp.

00:02:03.185 --> 00:02:06.125
And we got many other activities too.
Glenn, Chris, Gord,

00:02:06.155 --> 00:02:07.025
what else did we do?

00:02:07.715 --> 00:02:09.695
- And you got those—
- Yeah.
- For a big hit.

00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:10.115
- Yeah,

00:02:10.385 --> 00:02:12.515
what about those squats you were doing when you were,

00:02:12.545 --> 00:02:13.715
you were pulling creatures

00:02:13.795 --> 00:02:15.595
out of the middle of the ocean.

00:02:16.405 --> 00:02:17.305
- Oh, yeah, that too.

00:02:17.305 --> 00:02:20.215
We were pulling some crazy creatures out of the middle of the ocean.

00:02:20.245 --> 00:02:22.225
Can't tell you what type of creatures they were yet.

00:02:22.225 --> 00:02:27.115
We were on Blacktip. Blacktip. You know Josh, the Blacktip guy

00:02:27.584 --> 00:02:31.785
out there who's been catching these massive, like,
flounders and stuff? Well, we caught a lot of good

00:02:31.785 --> 00:02:34.334
stuff out there that it was definitely a workout.

00:02:34.334 --> 00:02:34.635
Like,

00:02:34.995 --> 00:02:39.015
bringing it up and you held your core tight
the whole time, so it got you stronger there.

00:02:39.015 --> 00:02:44.525
So, that's what was so cool about doing all the shooting is that
it was always activities that kept us balanced, you know?

00:02:44.525 --> 00:02:50.415
You know, if we didn't work out that day, we were basically
working out doing the activity, doing the competition.

00:02:50.415 --> 00:02:57.345
So that's how we try to incorporate it so we can knock a few
things out at one time, but also make it, you know, entertaining and fun.

00:02:57.605 --> 00:03:03.605
- I would love to hear how beer pong, that
competition, can get you ready for some football.

00:03:03.975 --> 00:03:05.865
- That's some hand-eye coordination right there.

00:03:06.025 --> 00:03:06.235
- Yes.
- And mindset.

00:03:07.755 --> 00:03:09.585
- That was actually water pong for Rob.

00:03:09.675 --> 00:03:12.285
Everyone else was, you know, having a little bit more fun.

00:03:12.345 --> 00:03:14.745
You gotta drain it in the cup. You gotta drop it in the bucket.

00:03:15.165 --> 00:03:16.635
We all know what's going on with that.

00:03:16.635 --> 00:03:19.845
So, you know, Rob had to get ready for the season.

00:03:19.845 --> 00:03:24.585
So, you know, we gave him an excuse to just have
some fun and drink some water and get hydrated.

00:03:25.085 --> 00:03:26.765
- I was playing water pong for real.

00:03:26.765 --> 00:03:30.275
I think that's why I, you know, I placed pretty high.

00:03:30.275 --> 00:03:32.855
I didn't, you know, I'm not gonna say if I won or not, which

00:03:33.315 --> 00:03:40.605
I didn't, but I came close because I had water
and everyone else was getting tipsy and I was just laughing

00:03:40.605 --> 00:03:43.095
cuz I knew they couldn't see the cups properly and I could.

00:03:46.295 --> 00:03:53.015
- So he was cheating, you guys! No, is there anything for
the channel that one of you really wants to do that

00:03:53.015 --> 00:03:53.495
