00:03:54.365 --> 00:03:59.225
- Yeah, so we actually did a tightroping
competition as well, which I thought was pretty cool.

00:03:59.225 --> 00:04:02.375
And I wanted to keep going higher and higher
on the tightrope, and everyone else

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.660
