00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:08.290
So that's something maybe next time, we
weren't very good at it,

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:12.120
but I don't—
- Why are you telling all of our secrets, bro?

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:16.680
- But, I mean, we got some other cool stuff, competing
against each other in every single one, but some fun

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:23.040
